{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51686","headline":"滕王阁 · 罗隐","name":"滕王阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[江神]有意怜才子，歘忽威灵助去程。\n一席清风雷电疾，满碑佳句雪冰清。\n焕然丽藻传千古，赫尔英名动两京。\n若匪幽冥[佑词]客，至今佳景绝无声。\n（《岁时广记》三五《重九》）（〖1〗据《醒世恒言》卷四十《马当神风送滕王阁》补缺文。\n《醒世恒言》录此诗，前四句除「一席」作「一夕」外，余全同。\n後四句改动稍多，录如次：「直教丽藻传千古，不但雄名动两京。\n不是明灵佑祠客，洪都佳景绝无声。\n」「祠客」显爲「词客」之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}